Mods: {
	ZeroHourMilitaryMod: {
		Changelog: {
			Version: v4.13-4.12
			Lines:
				'''
				[+] Added a new NPC: Shell-shocked Pilot.
				[+] Restored weapons and the main menu from build v2022.0.4.
				[+] Added a new weapon for the Ranged: the Vanector (i.e., Vane's Vector).
				[*] Fixed XT-017 Scorpion bestiary.

				[+] Added a new weapon for the Summoner: Diagnosis.
				[+] Discord is now available!
				[+] You can now pat Virili!
				[+] The interface and feedback with the FPV Drun have been improved. 
				[+] Subatomic Decay. 
				[+] Added the option to change the Plague and Irradiated icon to any of the ones from older Calamity builds.
				[*] XT-017 Scorpion AI changes + new attacks, phases and recoil.
				[*] XT-017 Scorpion base movement speed was increased from 20 to 36, but now he's moving freely.
				[*] Fixed an issue where the ToxicRain.raw shader (green rain) was closed incorrectly, causing the game to crash.
				[-]
				'''
		}

